00:01:08.717 --> 00:01:10.293
How do you get more sleep?

00:01:10.293 --> 00:01:12.581
How do you finally manage
this part of your life

00:01:12.581 --> 00:01:14.949
because look, we all have
a lot of expectations,

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.588
a lot of demands on our lives,

00:01:16.588 --> 00:01:19.573
