homes outside the bedroom.

00:02:56.414 --> 00:02:59.938
Turning off the lights, the bright lights

00:02:59.938 --> 00:03:01.105
making it sort of,

00:03:01.105 --> 00:03:03.015
I just have one nightstand light

00:03:03.015 --> 00:03:05.388
and one light in the bathroom.

00:03:05.388 --> 00:03:09.305
Then having a really
really hot wonderful bath.

00:03:10.362 --> 00:03:11.953
