- Mhmm, I guess when you go
on a hot tub late at night,

00:03:38.993 --> 00:03:40.025
I always feel ready to sleep.

00:03:40.025 --> 00:03:41.617
- Exactly, you feel exactly.

00:03:41.617 --> 00:03:43.630
The hot tub it's a perfect--

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.610
- [Interviewer] So do a hot
tub dip if you have a hot tub.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.740
- If you have a hot tub go to a hot tub.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:51.073
I don't have a hot tub so I do the bath.

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:53.732
And then put on,

00:03:55.502 --> 00:03:57.760
if you sleep naked, you sleep naked.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.760
But if you wear PJs and
night dress or whatever,

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.025
make sure that you wear clothes for bed.

00:04:06.025 --> 00:04:08.601
I used to sleep in my gym clothes

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:11.918
and then your brain gets
this confusing messages.

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:13.043
