- I'm going to the gym

00:04:13.043 --> 00:04:14.558
or are we powering down?

00:04:14.558 --> 00:04:15.738
So even if you wear a t-shirt,

00:04:15.738 --> 00:04:19.865
make sure it's not a
t-shirt you wear to the gym.

00:04:19.865 --> 00:04:23.448
And then in bed I only
read physical books.

00:04:25.957 --> 00:04:27.140
I don't read anything--
- No devices.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.981
- On screens.

00:04:28.981 --> 00:04:32.166
And anybody who is reading
The Sleep Revolution in bed

00:04:32.166 --> 00:04:34.548
I will consider it a personal victory

00:04:34.548 --> 00:04:36.837
