asleep while reading it.

00:04:36.837 --> 00:04:39.539
- Read 20, 20 pages a night, fall asleep.

00:04:39.539 --> 00:04:41.593
- Whatever, 10 pages, you get drowsy,

00:04:41.593 --> 00:04:43.939
you let the book drop,
you turn off the light,

00:04:43.939 --> 00:04:45.398
you're asleep.

00:04:45.398 --> 00:04:47.414
So that is incredibly important,

00:04:47.414 --> 00:04:49.791
for those who have children,

00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:52.463
you know that that's how
